        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana CHE4, Extra Cabin Swivel Hook Eye</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSolid brass cabin hook eye for use with the <a href=\"/products/4-inch-cabin-swivel-door-hook-deltana-chk4\"><b>Deltana CHK4 4\" Cabin Swivel Hook</b></a> and the\r\n<a href=\"/products/6-inch-cabin-swivel-door-hook-deltana-chk6\"><b>Deltana CHK6 6\" Cabin Swivel Hook</b></a>. This extra hook eye allows you to hook a door 2 ways, in the open and / or closed position. Packaged with mounting screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-CHE4-Specifications.gif?v=1704354597\" width=\"503\" height=\"182\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana CHE4 Cabin Swivel Hook Eye Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> the for Deltana CHE4 Replacement Cabin Swivel Hook Eye:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Plate Height: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Plate Width: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with matching finish screws.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/CHE4.pdf?v=1691095314\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana CHE4 Specifications Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
