                "title": "Cabin Swivel Hook Eye, Deltana CHE4",
                "description": "Cabin Swivel Hook Eye Deltana CHE4 - Solid brass cabin hook eye for use with the Deltana CHK4 4 Inch Cabin Swivel Hook and the Deltana CHK6 6 Inch Cabin Swivel Hook. This extra hook eye allows you to hook a door 2 ways, in the open and / or closed position. Packaged with mounting screws.",
